        "en": "Clients emphasize the loving, attentive care shown toward their dogs and cats across routine exams, wellness checkups, and urgent situations. Owners of elderly pets, puppies, and working dogs note that the veterinary team handles animals with patience and kindness. Reviewers appreciate that practitioners take time to comfort animals throughout treatments."
